Mercenary (warlock):
You didn’t sell your soul or your child for power; instead, you shake hands with men in pointy hats, and agree to do favors for them in exhange for some of their power. Whereas other warlocks experience the thrill and terror of cosmic horror, you instead face the existential dread of the mundanity of magical logistics.
​
1st Level: Otherworldly Patron(s)
as opposed to having one patron who gives you power
in exchange for service, you actively seek them out,
you never know what your going to get in terms of subclass bonuses until you have it.

