​​
10th level: Dual-Defense
Starting at 10th level, you can use a reaction to add +5 to your AC without using a spellslot, this can only be used one time per long rest,
and lasts till the start of your next turn.

​
14th level: Squad Strike
Starting at 14th level, in exchange for 100gp, you can use your Action to summon up to 2 hired underlings, they act independently of you, but respond to your commands, and both share a turn.

